flowchart TD
    A[User opens AAC Session page] --> B[Select user]
    B --> C[START button]
    C --> D[Create session_id + load LTM/STM/PB]

    D --> E{Camera toggle ON?}
    E -- No --> F[face_signals = null]
    E -- Yes --> G[Webcam preview + face detection]
    G --> H{Face detected?}
    H -- No --> F
    H -- Yes --> I[face_signals dict]

    D --> J{Mode}
    J --> K[Normal mode: partner text send]
    J --> L[SPEAK button]

    subgraph Normal Pipeline
      K --> N1[FaceCueNode]
      N1 --> N2[RouterNode: Personal/Contextual/Open-domain]
      N2 --> N3[SourcePriorityPlannerNode]
      N3 --> N4[RetrieveFromPoolNode with fallback]
      N4 --> N5[EvidenceRefiner + CoverageCheck]
      N5 --> N6[GroundednessGuardNode]
      N6 --> N7[CandidateGeneratorNode]
      N7 --> N8[Exactly 3 options]
    end

    subgraph Speak Pipeline
      L --> S1[FaceCueNode]
      S1 --> S2[SpeakPlannerNode]
      S2 --> S3[Generate 20-30 grouped suggestions]
      S3 --> S4[Today / Next few days / Reminders / People-topics]
    end

    N8 --> Q[Select or edit custom response]
    S4 --> Q
    Q --> R[Confirm gate]
    R --> T[Final Spoken Output area + transcript]

    R --> U{Memory Update toggle ON?}
    U -- No --> V[No memory mutation]
    U -- Yes --> W[Memory Update Subgraph]
    W --> W1[PB weight boost or new exemplar]
    W --> W2[STM recent_turn + situation_hint]
    W --> W3[LTM requires approval placeholder]

    N2 --> X[Debug panel router label]
    N3 --> Y[Debug panel search order]
    N4 --> Z[Debug panel sources + latency]
    I --> AA[Debug panel face cue summary]
